splay=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>A</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>36</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>36</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>36</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>36</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>l</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>All that's left now is to confirm that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"465\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D459 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msqrt><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.174em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> does indeed give a maximum value of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"466\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D459 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> To do this, we use the first derivative test. We write up a table of values:</p>\n<table rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"10\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:1px solid black; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 4mm; margin-top: 4mm\">\n<tbody><tr>\n    <td width=\"60px\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">Interval</td>\n    <td width=\"60px\" align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"467\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msqrt><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.174em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n    <td width=\"40px\" align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"468\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msqrt><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.174em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n    <td width=\"60px\" align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"469\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msqrt><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.174em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n    <td width=\"60px\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">Test Point</td>\n    <td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"470\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n    <td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"471\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n    <td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"472\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n    <td width=\"60px\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\" style=\"font-weight:bold\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"473\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-var\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2032\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n    <td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"474\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mo>+</mo></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n    <td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"475\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n    <td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"476\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mo>−</mo></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n    <td width=\"60px\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\" style=\"font-weight:bold\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"477\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n    <td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"478\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2197\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">↗</mo></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n    <td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"479\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c78\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>max</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n    <td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"480\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2198\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">↘</mo></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>So, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"481\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D459 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msqrt><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.174em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> does indeed give a maximum, and the area of the resulting triangle will be the largest possible.</p>\n<p>Finally, the maximum possible area is</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"482\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 15.678em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n